1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,460
M1: The date of the computer conference has been set for next Tuesday.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:08,620
Could you do me a favor and call the hotel we deal with to make reservations for two rooms?

3
00:00:09,295 --> 00:00:11,360
M2: Sure, Paul, I will take care of it right away.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:15,140
But what are you going to do about the meeting you had scheduled with Mr. Nolan?

5
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,160
Do you want me to call him and cancel?

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,975
M1: Oh, I completely forgot all about him.

7
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:22,440
You know, I can't miss this meeting with him.

8
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,620
It's too important.

9
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:28,420
On second thought, I think I'd better send Sally to New York to attend the conference with you.

10
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:34,210
She has been working on the presentation, and she should be able to make the presentation in my place.

11
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:37,675
M2: You're right, but Sally might not be too happy to hear about this.

12
00:00:38,105 --> 00:00:40,940
I think she has a trip scheduled the week after with Mr. Singh.
